=== robomimic

I led development on this framework for robot learning from demonstrations. It offers a broad set of demonstration datasets collected on robot manipulation domains, and learning algorithms to learn from these datasets, in the hopes of facilitating progress in this important field. See the [https://arise-initiative.github.io/robomimic-web/ project website] for more information.

