=== robosuite

Simulation framework for robotic manipulation. Features include several robot models, controllers, and benchmark tasks, procedural generation of tasks, multi-modal sensors, and support for human demonstrations. See the [http://robosuite.ai/ website] for more information or try the [https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite code] out yourself.

